<title>PHILIPPINES: Waterfront 1996/97 net rises sharply.</title>
<headline>Waterfront 1996/97 net rises sharply.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fiscal year ended March 1997</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (pesos)   0.15 vs 0.07</p>
<p>    Revenue			    259.0 vs 30.8</p>
<p>    Net income			 134.5 vs 30.8</p>
<p>Note: Full name Waterfront Philippines Inc. The company said the substantial increase was due to the commercial operation of its first casino hotel since October 1996.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
